:false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d70\"},\"ref\":\"d70\",\"snippet\":\" ... The book was longlisted for the Man Asian Literary Prize in 2011. However, after the 2012 anti-Japanese demonstrations in China, Murakami's books were removed from sale there, along with those of other Japanese authors. Murakami criticized the China–Japan political territorial dispute, characterizing the overwrought nationalistic ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haruki_Murakami\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d71\"},\"ref\":\"d71\",\"snippet\":\" ... adult |\\n\\nSI Leeds Literary Prize\\n\\n| Deadline | 13 May 2024 |\\n\\n|---|---|\\n\\n| Entry Fee | £10 |\\n\\n| First Prize | £4,000 |\\n\\n| Eligibility (writer) | Black and Asian women writers aged 18 or over, based in the UK |\\n\\n| Eligibility (submission) | Full manuscript plus 500 word synopsis |\\n\\n| Genre | Fiction |\\n\\nFirst Pages Prize\\n\\n| Deadline | 10 April 2024 ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.novel-software.com/novel-writing-competitions/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d57\"},\"ref\":\"d57\",\"snippet\":\" ... The Asian/Pacific American Librarians Association (APALA), an affiliate of the American Library Association, awards titles based on their literary and artistic merit.\\n\\nAudie Awards recognize distinction in audiobooks and spoken word entertainment in numerous genres. The awards are sponsored by the Audio Publishers Association (APA).\\n\\nBooker Prize ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.bridgewaterpubliclibrary.org/award-winners\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"2f172f44652f22821256a55600e91